1	// The whole crate is gated: Qwen3.5 needs the Triton AOT kernels from
2	// `pegainfer-kernels/qwen35`, which need Python + Triton at build time.
3	// Without the feature this compiles to an empty crate so plain workspace
4	// builds stay Python-free.
